msgid "Pixhawk (FMUv2) and PX4FMU (FMUv1)"
msgstr "Pixhawk（FMUv2）与 PX4FMU（FMUv1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:19
#: 19d2b578ad654d15ac490ffeceed6c2b 2677aefa32cf44d894f2c6735dee3367
#: 9d0e690be19b467e8a74603a8d362387 e22f5207b10c46df85100958b51a4663
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk (FMUv2) single board autopilot evolved from the original \"PX4 "
"system\", which consists of the PX4FMU and various piggyback boards "
"including the PX4IO and PX4IOAR."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk（FMUv2）单板飞控由最初的「PX4 系统」演化而来，该系统由 PX4FMU 及多种扩展板（包括 PX4IO 和 PX4IOAR）组成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:22
#: 16878a458d444c18a511365c0b3f931c 180fbe1314e44562b7c7fa105ae6f6c2
#: 8f6d226278b64666b0263c1c33b16121 fcc7067bb4044eb7802503fe3d2781a2
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk incorporates several additional features to provide extended "
"capabilities for our ArduPilot flight system."
msgstr "Pixhawk 集成了多项附加功能，为 ArduPilot 飞行系统提供了扩展能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:25
#: 1f21873b53e546338543867f1e27a7a7 63233917fe514ec99d715ef8d8e29303
#: d03e0248121745b6a1b14787e2f2849f e3143124b36843558c262345d0de9b81
msgid ""
"A connector diagram of the Pixhawk is shown below, but :ref:`Go to this link"
" for full information on the Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-overview>`"
msgstr ""
"下图为 Pixhawk 的接口示意图，:ref:`点击此链接查看 Pixhawk 完整信息 <common-pixhawk-overview>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:28
#: 6c0c1b86b4fb451281c1af26e1b7a9ea a35643a958d746be81b801f0697900aa
#: d5a2f730ea5a49f6b137f04ed30f80ad ff30cbe799a84c99b19a60a4942ca17d
msgid "The PX4FMU/PX4IO (FMUv1) Flight Management System Includes:"
msgstr "PX4FMU/PX4IO（FMUv1）飞行管理系统包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:30
#: 01a3899878dc42fdb5654bbd9b83367a 206ebb14aab142dba65c439a86437979
#: b2d4ef30a37b4146bb9c8251f9aa82e5 fba9a6cf1e2d4a0dab0b296c1d15e56e
msgid "**The PX4-FMU (Flight Management Unit).**"
msgstr "**PX4-FMU（飞行管理单元）。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:32
#: 16c12142b2dd4e2d9757076a9ffd57df 374247e505fd4da9936e9db440fd24cf
#: 9ef68493b55046179358e5d79e5e7887 b89dfca14fc74195a12203ec07669ee2
msgid ""
"A powerful Cortex M4F micro-controller and flash memory for controlling "
"flight and communications."
msgstr "强大的 Cortex M4F 微控制器和闪存，用于飞行控制和通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:34
#: 062257a23dce4a85962a3b3b3ebc8e1f 0e257a8e40f14485816a58c75c9bc382
#: 1c1c2584a2d34b37b63a2ffc11fc1f54 6fae96e7df474c099b0c7fde3a7c7afa
msgid "A socket for a plug in SD memory card."
msgstr "SD 存储卡插槽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:35
#: 4d9d30453f564d78b83d389388b9a6ff 9ef18fdffc4e42e883a3c71066a62849
#: b671f1deda1e4e99984f40b1e5ab182e b905e47cbe904fd6b3f0ada19dbbc81d
msgid "A 3 axis gyro for determining orientation."
msgstr "用于确定姿态的三轴陀螺仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:36
#: 3d9ad363e05647a0b4024b8fb6afd38f 55a46cff29ba488a9033d40fd98fb168
#: baa6e2935b514d90b770f5cc17701502 d31fd2d2844a4a0886968b08ca2acb7e
msgid "A 3 axis Accelerometer for determining outside influences."
msgstr "用于检测外部影响的三轴加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:37
#: 04ad6391a0d545c3b336125cac75ffb2 15a6fbd6a44e4571a4b5678e5e61d392
#: b1ea405ea0e043be9490b1ae8b97ed10 e057983342ad466cb117b294fcbda8de
msgid "A compass (magnetometer)."
msgstr "罗盘（磁力计）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:38
#: 016272de9b8049449a81ae049c686d3f 03df14c948a2497a97441c4ba3eba171
#: 45f1670f564b4a98b6dcab52289c3213 c56fe2144eb44006968c63bda3f319bc
msgid "A barometric pressure sensor for determining altitude."
msgstr "用于测量高度的气压计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:39
#: 7078d4f19da74d9284348b8ee890e197 88bfb6d97dde495fb6bcdd8f4c2053fa
#: d15904217fea4445aa30859e5053d948 d9e21df64ed24e88a181436bbf53ebb1
msgid ""
"A connection for an externally mountable UBLOX LEA GPS for determining "
"absolute position."
msgstr "外部可安装的 UBLOX LEA GPS 接口，用于确定绝对位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:41
#: 0edc7098afc94faab894b219761b10c8 8820f091998e411f9f25d5bf6694de49
#: b15344717b9649389224abcb8c23b035 f594694b9c5f49c9aae2e4e010affc32
msgid "Stackable board interconnections for adding various peripheral boards."
msgstr "可叠加扩展板的堆叠式板间互联接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:43
#: 1c3ed38f7be54291bfac7cd318bfd4ec 842fa23021eb4792a74386483f037299
#: d3e6f0a37ba84d4c857ab21e5969f3db f3fd6b2b40ff411282137d0653c19e04
msgid "Communications interfaces for USB, JTAG and Serial connections."
msgstr "USB、JTAG 和串口通信接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:44
#: 12807b3b7dfa4e60afb198d9c9cd1ff9 1650b4d3ef7b41feabd1da9c5b12e34c
#: 7e86d33d366a45f7ae164127ec4da4d8 ece30f017b6e4edea08a591b1df36c92
msgid "Connections for PPM-SUM RC radio input and servo outputs."
msgstr "PPM-SUM 遥控输入和舵机输出接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:46
#: 0b8bb0d71b964641a3c6b9b759f6c211 200604e97d3543e5b21b3efdff655a24
#: 41b0e2eeb2cd4824b2902ce0337a2e32 964faa1552844c42a6841d878274bae3
msgid "**The PX4-IO (Input Output) Board.**"
msgstr "**PX4-IO（输入输出）扩展板。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:48
#: 15302129482141f096bff26eae586b4f a0af6dc15bc24d149bcdf5db7b79376e
#: cc346c303c6b4ed1b7a229252ed2f189 cd2ef7b21547454c98618be8b1506d56
msgid "Contains its own on board micro-controller and stacks with the FMU."
msgstr "内置独立微控制器，可与 FMU 叠加安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:49
#: 0d132dc676a84e54a8ba0984666455b6 9ff5bff95784461e8f10615aded56d0c
#: f4f5f38894ef467e8853d66c06ba2a52 fd8d8585936943028c71c60adcb69a82
msgid "Direct battery input power supply."
msgstr "直接电池输入供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:50
#: 66b00e5876894060aa3dc4b707cd851a 77c3559126de4b04b4bb74b8fcd7ecbf
#: c4791e5e71a7487aac5a53fa537c2a50 e0bc6ef888b24a26b684a03baabfe742
msgid "8 High speed servo PWM outputs."
msgstr "8 路高速舵机 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:51
#: 99857e84bec54abda3e8b151b6eec012 a4d0d59d68b248a1b09fabe14ca74fbb
#: d22c525ac9954084b11191301b15108b e9ffa473db9a40a7a20c7d8ee5c271f0
msgid "Futaba SBUS or PPM-SUM serial servo output."
msgstr "Futaba SBUS 或 PPM-SUM 串行舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:52
#: 30b88924aa154ee9a95c123f8f4517b1 7cf51970da12483daf97cf977dd9d44f
#: a6d0c611b3ee40ebb91df113d55285c3 ce3f45dda26f41169f30d6b4f09b43e2
msgid "A variety of PPM-SUM / SBUS input connectors."
msgstr "多种 PPM-SUM / SBUS 输入接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:53
#: 004b729143a543f3a810e133c1cce295 67f257f8c67247179c3683f5b191c42e
#: 6e1fee9a53754fcca5e0639bfa0096d0 9a2c7bafe4c44cad918f320438250291
msgid ""
"Two user assignable relays, two 1/2 amp 5 volt outputs and an analog input "
"port."
msgstr "两路用户可分配继电器、两路 1/2 安 5V 输出及一路模拟输入端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:56
#: 388db1ddbc45452cb82c4bc2ed34215a 906a8892b4414d8195cfe974a01913b1
#: c2ed3d083fca4d16aa8f81a03f3385dd f932d6f5d31a4c488052367ea336b126
msgid "**The PX4FLOW Smart (Optical Flow) Camera.**"
msgstr "**PX4FLOW 智能光流摄像头。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:58
#: 9790e5d03f494d5d9148b3bbcc4fad38 d54d1f20c30a442eadf35140f30d9022
#: d5b726d3b6bb4aecb786a913fd8ed120 e74fccd503b74467ba6f5b969f8cd78a
msgid ""
"Specialized downward pointing camera module that uses ground texture and "
"features to determine aircraft motion over the ground."
msgstr "专用向下摄像头模块，通过识别地面纹理和特征来确定飞行器对地运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:60
#: 42f2875b9afa42d1b63b8501f5cb3a68 696d747399de4f648edd765e3f4bfc92
#: 6d04b3ae68da4452847c69850f025cee ca4356127b4a4fa3b6c9aa0e73664a8e
msgid ""
"The PX4FLOW has the same powerful Cortex M4F micro-controller as is used in "
"the PX4FMU."
msgstr "PX4FLOW 使用与 PX4FMU 相同的强大 Cortex M4F 微控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:62
#: 197dfdc8ac564a70bada1ce31e2b9673 2bc3b598a95942b89e6e471a3adf3a96
#: 6453af2ee69a447bbd4e5b36a29b2908 993f4e05f17c4bd29a7c6115ac89e100
msgid ""
"The built in micro-controller performs on board automated binned pixel image"
" analysis to determine motion relative to ground."
msgstr "内置微控制器自动执行像素图像的区块分析，以确定相对于地面的运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:64
#: 5281b73c8c354ea9bc723ecd651c81f6 69bfc0fbff6e43019c44409813df1d50
#: d827d3d40378478fb02ffacb93d6e54c fd8ffb0121a04e2d984cd4fec361a466
msgid ""
"A built in 3 axis gyro enables automatic compensation for variance in "
"aircraft tilt angle."
msgstr "内置三轴陀螺仪可自动补偿飞行器倾斜角度变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:67
#: 3861a752851b4915a36e641979093e0e 78e6ea94c18b4f728f94bafd61222798
#: a34201c5d7be4f2f88e505ee75febe8b b35c0824966b41b39ab47de11f4b1950
msgid ""
"**The PX4-IOAR Quad Carrier is a specialized interface board for the Parrot "
"AR.Drone.**"
msgstr "**PX4-IOAR 四旋翼载板是专为 Parrot AR.Drone 设计的专用接口板。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:70
#: 36853210ee664e50aba6264730be77de 58b29d4abd79420aab662273fe8c1e2c
#: 622558f3a91843d8b537aa95561c3be8 f7123c9292d74694991d0c5bea761600
msgid ""
"**The PX4FMU circuit board comes preassembled and ready to load the firmware"
" for your airframe using the Mission Planner.**"
msgstr "**PX4FMU 电路板出厂时已预装完毕，可直接通过 Mission Planner 为您的机型加载固件。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:77
#: 144f148ada324fa997781ceac226fa87 306ada73ea66442b9ea2a7c8fd81d4d5
#: 73cee850968e46d7972362fa15e7785b 774d2371c4144b49a165c09cf5cd396a
msgid "Detailed Description"
msgstr "详细说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:82
#: 01dffd61e535479b9821a640896d6207 6822eaa676b54f2ea2d8d1741bd560e1
#: 90a6cb1ac67141b1a7ad9b0ee8374108 e523a1d5cbd04a0fbea1432742e1d120
msgid ""
"**The Back of the PX4FMU board showing the SD card carrier and buzzer "
"socket:**"
msgstr "**PX4FMU 板背面，显示 SD 卡槽和蜂鸣器插座：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:89
#: 3d49e9d6ec77483cbe882a0a22f3f0ac 6d70dfdda4244b7cb84bc61056db3cb1
#: 857e5b83fdd54c22bf92b815a2fc26e3 9e1ec54ed3df414486a8275ce1b633f0
msgid "PX4FMU Connector diagram"
msgstr "PX4FMU 接口示意图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:95
#: 90d43f80b09947d9933738b53d1cd3aa 9e446302e1a944229145ff635c2d83dc
#: b533db9fbd724813b687a06490a68684 c74f892c55c94fa4b030d22b4f7722bc
msgid "Analog and digital pins"
msgstr "模拟与数字引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:97
#: 3f12b90fe71b4564beddd84daae49539 6707def80f0e45fab4bee40464739e70
#: a58bef5373be454c9c554140793fb553 f43a5a4667874ee48ca5956ed831daab
msgid ""
"This section lists what pins (analog and digital) are available on the "
"PX4FMU."
msgstr "本节列出 PX4FMU 上可用的引脚（模拟和数字）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:100
#: 1e6313d056f04ed69be47f08946df2a8 27a32306a3c24220aa74c0959ae4badd
#: 684f73c48a7c4094bbbb177f90dfc4ec 960f1a1eed5d47d687240b334abc14ca
msgid "PX4v1 Analog inputs"
msgstr "PX4v1 模拟输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:102
#: 23dc96eebb114c86a9f8bde3ceb25df1 47c78a9c1eb54c6da2f57c1744c03b15
#: 836819ed9625410ca42e3a24f1c8d729 ba68480d89af4b789c998c5fa6085fea
msgid ""
"The PX4FMUv1 has the following “available” Analog input port pins which may "
"be put to a variety of uses."
msgstr "PX4FMUv1 提供以下「可用」模拟输入引脚，可用于多种用途。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:105
#: 352fd6d7aa37490eb5c4a8122cff9669 c10f0b3fdf8f4d56ac873f0d21c781d6
#: e17d3f82f2fa4d6fbec5553f7de0dc3a ff1b81a233c1454d9505628b05aa2ae2
msgid "**Pin 10** (High voltage analog pin):"
msgstr "**引脚 10** （高电压模拟引脚）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:107
#: 0bc8c7ca4f654127b74aef249b809e84 84859a1547ae448f8dec8eba16aeec9b
#: c872b843c83f4e0b9d4ee40fa4c77cd2 e0d3520b0b5e4734b5765ab754659227
msgid ""
"FMU battery voltage measured on pin 5 of the 15 pin multi-connector on the "
"end of the FMU board. It has 5.7:1 scaling, allowing it to measure up to "
"18.8V."
msgstr "FMU 电池电压，在 FMU 板末端 15 针多功能连接器的第 5 针测量。缩放比为 5.7:1，可测量最高 18.8V 的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:110
#: 5205a3c0b9504853ac50100bc95dc11d a5bc73cdc22f4dbdaa539f284cc8a129
#: c86239f0f4d5449bbb35dd565a68fddb f49490afab8d4236ab2bd4c0508ed39a
msgid ""
"Located on pin 5 of the DF13 15 pin \"multi-connector\" of the PX4FMU board."
msgstr "位于 PX4FMU 板 DF13 15 针「多功能连接器」的第 5 针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:112
#: 3e9f6303938340659df69d89e28938b6 71b2ccacec734c08b32fe4cfe800f369
#: e41b2a150c3042d8a625629f3fb18ba2 f1c8e9eb2a8d4228a58d2d51fe0fd62a
msgid ""
"This pin can accept up to 18.6 volts. (You can add an additional resistor "
"divider and set the scaling appropriately for higher voltages)."
msgstr "此引脚最高可承受 18.6V（您可以添加分压电阻并相应调整缩放比以支持更高电压）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:115
#: 5138e6bfc8854f6c9d576ca906a7837a a5d4f07049804354b1aee0ef5547eee8
#: a7b630a85f714004a3118cf230b8faa4 f9f252e0f7fd4bdb8dc21154d4396c14
msgid ""
"With the Advanced Parameter VOLT_DIVIDER set to 1 voltage can be read "
"directly."
msgstr "将高级参数 VOLT_DIVIDER 设为 1 后，可直接读取电压值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:118
#: 004ec3eb5d5c4dc8ad5c147e1139d5b3 3ca87e0582574bbeae97814a6f751621
#: 6ccb45cdd8084cf2a8fe3e779a9d1a15 8e55fe40406e4612b13a55c1186899b0
msgid ""
"For old releases VOLT_DIVIDER needed to be set to 5.66 for direct voltage "
"scaling."
msgstr "在旧版本中，需将 VOLT_DIVIDER 设为 5.66 才能直接缩放电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:121
