#: b3de03070cc5460e87c2c7fc23ea66cf d8dbbc0b046841d69f1f8bd1fe75358d
msgid ""
"**Pin 101**: Battery current measured on the pin next to the power connector"
" on the IO board."
msgstr "**引脚 101**：在 IO 板电源接口旁边引脚测量的电池电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:172
#: 2e862904c7a040fdb3076331209617a9 30697a295e58438ebb76b046ff118bc9
#: 3a00ac0ad43b4cea91d6a969e774871d d5312456a60f422387e75e1a2a60c075
msgid ""
"A virtual analog input pin for a battery current sensor connected to the "
"\"current\" pin next to the power connector on the PX4IO."
msgstr "连接到 PX4IO 电源接口旁「current」引脚的电池电流传感器虚拟模拟输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:178
#: 23179a9cb64f459b9002fcfee4967efd 7ac2d71412474ba4b20936e7f1d1e726
#: b0590622121b4f788a9c8607364a109f b50872a5717a4776885b2635e5648794
msgid "You need to be careful"
msgstr "请注意"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:178
#: 2f577069d6ac4a7b82f45ba9c39154a5 5199064fdc3c4e8d9c3d2a7537bdee46
#: 5ee5dc97dd7741cb966beecca56e3119 ebb52a37ac884606ac5f5c56faae53f8
msgid ""
"to use a current sensor that will not provide over 3.3V as too high a "
"voltage on this pin can cause the PX4IO to reset."
msgstr "要使用不会超过 3.3V 输出的电流传感器，因为此引脚电压过高会导致 PX4IO 复位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:181
#: 71966bad4c5e4fd5aeb1ed131ed94e1f 8512dd050e1f4adb9f883627853fd5f4
#: e9676df4433540e78ae1efe8e4072ebe f75e7c3393834089a9f00705f42d9901
msgid ""
"For use with a current sensor, a 0.1uF capacitor between this pin and ground"
" will help reduce \"noise\"."
msgstr "与电流传感器配合使用时，在此引脚与地之间连接 0.1uF 电容有助于减少「噪声」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:191
#: 2f8256490d2248bc9b59a492dc94db9d a556d71a9a8944abbcf92818c3d25e95
#: cedff37f207c4e7cab5ccc4b1e0652c6 dc0353e986284faa9dc8c02659c781f7
msgid "PX4v1 Digital outputs"
msgstr "PX4v1 数字输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:193
#: 7ec1dd9abc844f059ad90cc7356b67a1 9f594fcbbd6548fcae715d94b661066c
#: eb55bd5e571844309a09a3cd921c1646 fe91b7d06ce34abeb0ae56e0d0a17556
msgid ""
"The PX4V1 digital output pins come in two types, one is pins that give 5V "
"when on and 0V when off, and the other are 'relay' pins which provide low "
"resistance when on and high resistance when off."
msgstr "PX4V1 数字输出引脚分两种类型：一种在开启时输出 5V、关闭时输出 0V；另一种为「继电器」引脚，开启时提供低阻抗、关闭时提供高阻抗。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:197
#: 189043686eda4553862a5a84167cecc7 67bf290cfdc9411da89c2ebdd2828c3d
#: 815552f301a341e38250b3d61476593e bea10760bc194183b2d12fd9d2430c18
